ilm contest and mentioned that people love it when she makes them new things.\n  - feelings: Writing is a way for Joanna to express her feelings, act as an escape, put thoughts down, and create something good from them, as words have a magical way of healing.\n  - script: Joanna is filming a movie from her road-trip script. An actor praised the script, making Joanna excited and giving her chills.\n  - writing projects: Joanna is busy with writing projects, which she finds to be the best thing ever, a mix of highs and lows. Writing is an escape, a way to express feelings, and healing.\n  - screenplay: Joanna wrote parts of a screenplay that appeared on the big screen yesterday and submitted a recent screenplay to a film contest.\n  - audition: Joanna had an audition for a writing gig yesterday; she feels mixed emotions but is excited, and Nate wished her luck.\n  - big screen: Joanna is writing a movie script, a love story with challenges, hoping to get it on the big screen.\n  - producer: Joanna hopes a producer or director will like her screenplay enough for it to be shown on the big screen.\n  - Joanna: Joanna is filming her own movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and is excited to show her vision.\n  - romance: Joanna's first full screenplay, finished last Friday, is a mix of drama and romance.\n  - director: Joanna hopes a director falls in love with her screenplay to get it on the big screen.\n  - writing: Joanna feels she cannot stop writing recently, appreciating Nate's support and encouragement.\n  - directors: Joanna finished and printed her first full screenplay last Friday, hoping directors and producers will like it enough for it to be produced.\n  - road-trip script: Joanna is filming her own movie based on the road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and feels it is full of potential to show her vision.\n  - happiness: Joanna stated she will always remember moments that bring happiness and reminded Nate t